{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04351","headline":"洛川怀古 · 刘希夷","name":"洛川怀古","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"萋萋春草绿，悲歌牧征马。\n行见白头翁，坐泣青竹下。\n感叹前问之，赠予辛苦词。\n岁月移今古，山河更盛衰。\n晋家都洛滨，朝廷多近臣。\n词赋归潘岳，繁华称季伦。\n梓泽春草菲，河阳乱华飞。\n绿珠不可夺，白首同所归。\n高楼倏冥灭，茂林久摧折。\n昔时歌舞台，今成狐兔穴。\n人事互消亡，世路多悲伤。\n北邙是吾宅，东岳爲吾乡。\n君看北邙道，髑髅萦蔓草。\n芳□□□□，□□□□□。\n碑茔或半存，荆棘敛幽魂。\n挥涕弃之去，不忍闻此言。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘希夷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04351.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04351","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}